      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "• The Wolf Set's horns protrude backwards instead on the sides, as with stereotypical Viking helmets popularized by the 1876 rendition of Wagner's Der Ring des Nibelungen.\n• Frost resist does not stack with Frost resistance mead, Yagluth power or other armor pieces.\n• Frost resist will override the frost weakness from being Wet.\n• Frost resist prevents Cold and Freezing effect."
