  "full_text": "Wolf Armor\n\nIntroduction. Wolf Armor is a Mountain-tier armor. This set is the tier above Iron Armor and Root Set, and is replaced by Padded Armor and Vilebone Set, respectively.\n\nArmor pieces. This set of armor has four pieces, which are crafted and upgraded at both the Workbench and the Forge.\n\nNotes. • The Wolf Set's horns protrude backwards instead on the sides, as with stereotypical Viking helmets popularized by the 1876 rendition of Wagner's Der Ring des Nibelungen.\n• Frost resist does not stack with Frost resistance mead, Yagluth power or other armor pieces.\n• Frost resist will override the frost weakness from being Wet.\n• Frost resist prevents Cold and Freezing effect.",
